# Mapbox public token for the Yanaka map in src/components/CityWalk.astro.
#
# This is a `pk.` public token — it is compiled into the client bundle and is
# visible to anyone who views the site. It is kept out of the repository so the
# token can be rotated without a commit, not because it can be kept secret.
# The real protection is a URL restriction on the token in the Mapbox dashboard
# (allow `curio.guide` and `localhost`).
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill it in for local development. On deploys the
# same value comes from the PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN repository secret
# (Settings > Secrets and variables > Actions).
PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
